### =========================================================================
### 🌐 SWIFT Hub & Clearing House - Facilitator HTTP Client Suite
### =========================================================================
### Instructions:
### 1. Select the active environment ('local-alpha', 'local-beta', or 'workshop-live').
### 2. Click the green play icon (▶) next to any request to execute it.
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. SWIFT Hub Health Check
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Check that the central SWIFT Hub is running.
GET {{hubUrl}}/health

> {%
    client.test("SWIFT Hub health check returns 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Hub status is not 200");
        client.assert(response.body.status === "OK", "Hub status is not OK");
    });
%}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Live Scoreboard State & Leaderboard Metrics
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fetch real-time bank rankings, throughput, error rates, and registered nodes.
GET {{hubUrl}}/swift/metrics

> {%
    client.test("Metrics return connected banks and scoreboard", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Metrics status is not 200");
        client.assert(Array.isArray(response.body.connectedBanks), "Connected banks is not an array");
    });
%}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Audit Ledger & Conservation of Money Inspection
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Inspect the central audit ledger to verify that no money was created or lost.
GET {{hubUrl}}/swift/ledger

> {%
    client.test("Ledger verifies conservation of money", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Ledger status is not 200");
        client.assert(response.body.isConservationOfMoneyVerified === true, "Conservation of money check failed!");
    });
%}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Register a Participant Bank Node Manually
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Register Bank Alpha with its BIC and local/tunnel webhook URL.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bic": "{{bic}}",
  "name": "{{bankName}}",
  "webhookUrl": "{{bankUrl}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("Bank registered successfully", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Registration failed");
        client.assert(response.body.status === "REGISTERED", "Status is not REGISTERED");
    });
%}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Register Bank Beta Manually
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Register Bank Beta on port 8081.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bic": "BANKBXXX",
  "name": "Bank Beta",
  "webhookUrl": "http://localhost:8081"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Dispatch Inter-Bank Transfer Directly via SWIFT Network
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dispatch an inter-bank settlement from Bank Alpha to Bank Beta.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "swift-tx-{{$uuid}}",
  "fromIban": "{{iban}}",
  "toIban": "{{targetIban}}",
  "amountCents": 75000,
  "reference": "Facilitator Test Settlement"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Traffic Simulator - Start Continuous Traffic Flow
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Start continuous simulated customer traffic across connected banks (every 2s).
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/start?intervalMs=2000

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Traffic Simulator - Trigger a 5-Transaction Burst (⚡ Mini Wave)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Send 5 rapid inter-bank transfers across connected banks.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/burst?count=5

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Traffic Simulator - Trigger a 20-Transaction Surge (💥 Chaos Spike)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Send a high-volume surge of 20 rapid transfers to test resilience under load.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/burst?count=20

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Traffic Simulator - Stop Traffic Generation
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pause all automated background traffic simulation.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/stop

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Traffic Simulator - Check Status
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Returns RUNNING or STOPPED along with the current interval.
GET {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/status

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. Traffic Simulator - One-off Deposit Test Scenario (+50.00 EUR)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run positive deposit scenario for each registered bank: deposit 50 EUR and assert 50 EUR balance.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/scenario/deposit-positive

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. Traffic Simulator - One-off Deposit Test Scenario (-50.00 EUR)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run negative deposit scenario for each registered bank: deposit -50 EUR, assert error received and not 0 EUR in account.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/scenario/deposit-negative

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. Traffic Simulator - One-off Deposit & Withdraw Test Scenario
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run deposit & withdraw scenario for each registered bank: deposit 50 EUR, withdraw 20 EUR, assert 30 EUR balance and statement lines.
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/scenario/withdraw

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. Traffic Simulator - Run All Test Scenarios (With Statement Verification)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run all one-off test scenarios for all registered banks (comparing expected ledger vs actual bank statement).
POST {{hubUrl}}/swift/simulator/scenario/all
